# Yazi: fotograf secici, Android PickVisualMedia + iOS PHPicker, ortak arayuz. Kaynak: Snowlings AndroidPlatform.kt, IosPlatform.kt, NativeServices.swift, Platform.kt. 1600 px, JPEG 90/0.9, EXIF, 3200 ornekleme.
